abstract: >
  PysternBlot is a GPLv3 Python GUI application for building
  publication-ready Western blot panels with hierarchical
  lane annotations. It supports ECL and NIR fluorescence
  imaging modalities and provides tools for image adjustment,
  cropping, rotation, and multi-channel TIFF handling.
  Version 1.1.0 adds a legend export zone — an optional second
  selection rectangle that exports a region of the original
  image with the panel legend and molecular-weight markers
  drawn above it — plus a resizable, collapsible Original
  Image tab with controls reorganised into three rows for
  faster navigation.
keywords:
